message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Citation Analysis System"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, serverless system on AWS that tracks AI search visibility for
  generative engine optimization (GEO): it sends prompts to AI search engines and
  LLM providers such as ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, Claude and Amazon Bedrock,
  and runs citation analysis and brand monitoring on the answers.
authors:
  - name: "Amazon Web Services"
    website: "https://aws.amazon.com/"
